## How the Connection Works

| What | How |
|---|---|
| Proxy | `"proxy": "http://localhost:5000"` in frontend `package.json` forwards `/api/*` to backend |
| CORS | Backend allows `http://localhost:3000` via `cors()` |
| Axios baseURL | `/api/items` — relative, works with proxy in dev |
| Custom Hook | `useItems.js` centralises all API calls and state |

